/* `/` is SMT-LIB's Euclidean `div`: -7 / 2 is -4 (truncated division gives
   -3), and the quotient and remainder of `/` and `%` satisfy
   x = 2 * (x / 2) + x % 2 with 0 <= x % 2 < 2. */
forall (x: int). P x
s.t.
P (x: int): bool =mu (0 - 7) / 2 = 0 - 4 /\ x = 2 * (x / 2) + x % 2 /\ 0 <= x % 2 /\ x % 2 < 2;
